## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Sonnet 5.4 (name as tracked in this dataset; no such product page found on any public surface)
- **Short description:** Claimed to be Anthropic's mid-2026 Sonnet-class model. No independent evidence of a release, model card, announcement, or API route was found — treat as an unverified/phantom identity until the orchestrator confirms it against a vendor source.
- **Provider / access:** claimed `opencode/claude-sonnet-5.4` — **live-verified absent**: the OpenCode Console catalog (`https://opencode.ai/inference/v1/models`, fetched 2026-10-26) lists `claude-sonnet-4-5`, `claude-sonnet-4-6`, `claude-sonnet-5`, `claude-sonnet-5-5` and no `claude-sonnet-5.4`; the same gap exists on `https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/models`, `https://models.dev/providers/opencode` (132 OpenCode models) and OpenRouter's Anthropic list.
- **Release / knowledge:** no verified release date; Anthropic's published Sonnet lineage jumps 4.6 (2026-02-17) → 5 (2026-06-30) → 5.5 (2026-09-28) with no 5.4.
- **IDs:** none verified — no `claude-sonnet-5-4` ID on the Claude Platform, Bedrock, Vertex, OpenRouter, models.dev, Portkey's 44-model Anthropic list, or Databricks FMI list.
- **Context window:** no verified public specification (dataset claims 1,000,000 / 128,000 — not independently confirmable).
- **Modalities:** no verified public specification (dataset claims text+image in, text out).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-26):** no verified public price — the claimed $2.50/$12.50 per 1M matches no Anthropic Sonnet rate (Sonnet 5 and 5.5 are $2/$10, Sonnet 4.6 is $3/$15; $2.50/$12.50 is the Anthropic **Batch** rate of the Opus tier).
- **Architecture:** no verified public disclosure; Anthropic publishes no system card, model card, or model page for this name.

