### Negative-findings evidence (searches run 2026-10-26)

1. Anthropic official surfaces — `anthropic.com/claude/sonnet`, `anthropic.com/news/claude-sonnet-5`, `anthropic.com/claude-sonnet-5-5`, `platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations` (Active list: Fable 5.1, Mythos 5.1, Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5, Fable 5, Mythos 5, Opus 5, Sonnet 5, Opus 4.8/4.7/4.6/4.5, Sonnet 4.6, Haiku 4.5 — **no Sonnet 5.4**), `platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/model-ids-and-versions`.
2. OpenCode Console — live catalog `https://opencode.ai/inference/v1/models` plus `https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/console/models` (endpoints + pricing tables): no `claude-sonnet-5.4` row.
3. Independent aggregators — `https://models.dev/providers/opencode` (132 models), OpenRouter `openrouter.ai/anthropic`, Portkey (44 Anthropic models), Databricks Foundation Model APIs supported list, Mastra `opencode` provider docs: no Sonnet 5.4 entry.
4. Release-timeline/deprecation trackers — `endoflife.date/claude`, the Anthropic model timeline on hidekazu-konishi.com, the maintained Claude model list gist, `benchlm.ai/deprecations/anthropic`: Sonnet lane is 4.5 → 4.6 → 5 → 5.5 only.
5. Benchmark indexes — Artificial Analysis, BenchLM, Vals AI, LM Council, morphllm's Claude benchmark page: no "Claude Sonnet 5.4" row exists.

Conflicts considered: the dataset's `meta.json` claims a paid
`opencode/claude-sonnet-5.4` route at $2.50/$12.50 with a 1M/128K window, but
every live public catalog above contradicts it, so no score can be grounded.

